T*
(vibrating plate compactor while maintaining pedestrian access and protecting nearby parked) Tj
T*
(vehicles.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SITE OBSERVATIONS) Tj
T*
(-----------------) Tj
T*
(The site is located in a residential area with close proximity to pedestrian and vehicular) Tj
T*
(access. Excavation is performed near existing pipelines and services, suggesting potential) Tj
T*
(underground utilities. Multiple pieces of heavy machinery are in use, indicating a need for) Tj
T*
(caution around mobile plant operations. Environmental factors include exposure to dust and) Tj
T*
(possible noise concerns.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
